        "text": "{\"messages\":\"Channel: Group DM (C0C1DB92YHE)\\n\\n=== Message from Bodhi <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (UC99MFPU1) at 2026-09-19 23:41:11 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789875671.818889\\n\\nFiles: changes.md (ID: F0C386329SQ, text\\/plain, 15.3 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Bill C J <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U08RAN43DBJ) at 2026-09-15 08:50:20 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789476620.818169\\nQuestionnaire created in one facility is visible in others, cannot submit but gets saved as draft. tldr: Facility level filter is not working\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C2TDTK48G, image\\/png, 455.2 KB), image.png (ID: F0C2TDW1R4Y, image\\/png, 287.6 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Bill C J <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U08RAN43DBJ) at 2026-09-15 08:43:27 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789476207.811769\\n<@U08RAN43DBJ|Bill C J> has joined the conversation\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:48:47 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789044527.776839\\non the left admin sidebar , under the apps , there are more section, we need to show some indicator <@U07NP23BWQH|Vinu> can you suggest something ?\\nReactions: eyes (1)\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0UT9BVBQ, image\\/png, 498.8 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:28:46 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789043326.499919\\n\\u2022 unable to create a new valueset, its throwing a error that \\\"disable_composition\\\" is missing. \\n\\u2022 preview page is also throwing the same error\\nNote: We are able to verify the code in the component section\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0QE493RR, image\\/png, 465.6 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:21:14 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789042874.266799\\nThe Patient Actions trigger is not working even with a simple condition, such as: If the patient's age is 19, tag the patient as \\\"White.\\\"\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C1R0HUQ9E, image\\/png, 359.6 KB), image.png (ID: F0C0F8LD0NB, image\\/png, 372.7 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:17:34 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789042654.760399\\nFor the Action Value input field, the input type should dynamically change based on the selected field.\\nFor example:\\n\\u2022 If DOB is selected, display a DD\\/MM\\/YYYY date picker\\/input, similar to the one used on the Patient Registration page, instead of a plain text input.\\n\\u2022 If Blood Group is selected, display the same blood group dropdown used on the Patient Registration page.\\nSimilarly, for all other fields, use the appropriate input component and options that are already available on the Patient Registration page.\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0WHBRZ6E, image\\/png, 375.3 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:13:50 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789042430.177629\\nAdd a audit for the actions page, to show the user created and modified by\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0WGVV64A, image\\/png, 319.2 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:12:41 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789042361.500019\\n\\u2022 In the Actions section, there are multiple conditions, such as \\u201cTag the encounter,\\u201d which cannot be triggered when an appointment is created because the encounter does not exist at that point. Could we modify the Actions section to show only the actions that are actually supported for the given trigger\\/run?\\n\\u2022 Also, it is unclear how I can manually trigger an action on demand !\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C1QTREW0G, image\\/png, 538.1 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 08:02:16 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789041736.351589\\n*Enhancement*\\n\\nAdd the actions support in facility level, so that user can use facility level { encounter tag and patient tag }\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0WDNBW4A, image\\/png, 386.6 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 07:54:42 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789041282.896239\\nin the admin dashboard, not understanding the purpose of the search on the top right\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0F2XRB3R, image\\/png, 519.9 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 07:25:45 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789039545.566699\\nwhen there is no change in the form, disable the save form button\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0W71P99Q, image\\/png, 192.8 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 07:08:53 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789038533.422619\\nWhen the custom choice is set to <5 and is repeatable, the questionnaire was previously displayed as a multi-select dropdown. Currently, it is not. Was this change intentional?\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0ZQ944N8, image\\/png, 457.7 KB), image.png (ID: F0C1QFDCQL8, image\\/png, 306.7 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 07:00:26 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789038026.323649\\n1. when you are creating the custom options for the choices, you need to keep on scroll to the right side all the time to view the delete button\\n2. the option input area is also feels small\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0ZNSJDMJ, image\\/png, 514.9 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 06:55:03 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789037703.918819\\nshow a audit as well, when was it created and modified (Date & Time) along with the user name\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C1QCQJ4KA, image\\/png, 363.7 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 06:50:29 EDT === \\nMessage TS: 1789037429.313569\\nwhen we import a question via json, the actions related field is filling the question id, not the question itself !\\nFiles: image.png (ID: F0C0XUTLPL1, image\\/png, 380.9 KB)\\n\\n=== Message from Mohammed Nihal <[REDACTED_EMAIL]> (U022THM4U2U) at 2026-09-10 06:38:23 EDT ==