mplemented. Creation/listing now expose only supported triggers; direct legacy links show an unsupported notice without modifying saved data. Patient fields and instructions within supported appointment/questionnaire contexts remain available. | [Report](https://rebuildearth.slack.com/archives/C0C1DB92YHE/p1789042874266799) |\n| QA-41 — ValueSet creation and preview error. | Already fixed; verified | Existing ValueSet creation includes disable_composition; create/verification/preview/save browser regression passed. | [Report](https://rebuildearth.slack.com/archives/C0C1DB92YHE/p1789043326499919) |\n| QA-42 — Sidebar overflow indication. | Fixed | Overflowing sidebar displays an accessible More navigation control that scrolls down and disappears at the bottom. | [Report](https://rebuildearth.slack.com/archives/C0C1DB92YHE/p1789044527776839) |\n| QA-43 — Facility questionnaire filtering. | Partial; backend required | Initial and additional pickers now scope questionnaires to the current facility plus instance forms. Direct/stale cross-facility draft requests still need backend validation. | [Report](https://rebuildearth.slack.com/archives/C0C1DB92YHE/p1789476620818169) |\n\n## Supporting evidence\n\n- [Backend findings and required changes](backend-findings.md)\n- [Builder review](builder-verification.md)\n- [Actions review](actions-verification.md)\n- [Fill and response review](fill-verification.md)\n- [Original issue index](issues.md), [complete transcript](transcript.md), [raw archive](archive.json), and [screenshots](attachments.json).\n\nThe supporting review notes preserve the status at each review checkpoint; final validation in this document supersedes their earlier pending-test notes.\n",
